23	// the moderation datetime fields use `z.string().datetime({ offset: true })`,
24	// which ACCEPTS a non-UTC offset (`+02:00`), UNLIKE `z.string().datetime()` /
25	// `z.iso.datetime()` (which require a literal `Z`). The regex below therefore
